OL,3,GNEWSAArson ruled out after Grand
OL,4,ABurstin Hotel fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people arrested in connection with
OL,7,Fa fire at a seaside hotel will not face
OL,8,Fcharges, Kent Police has said.
OL,10,FInvestigators have found there was "no
OL,11,Fcriminal cause" to a blaze at the Grand
OL,12,FBurstin Hotel in Folkestone, according
OL,13,Fto the force.
OL,15,FAbout 280 people from the hotel and 90
OL,16,Fpeople from neighbouring flats had to
OL,17,Fevacuate when flames took hold in the
OL,18,Fearly hours of 19 September.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
